        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.poster.avif?t=1785943263\" width=840 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.webm?t=1785943263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.mp4?t=1785943263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪐Manipulate puzzles and uncover hidden hearts!✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interactive picture book style puzzles and mechanisms while hunting for hidden hearts across a ballpoint pen illustrated universe, in this sandbox object hunting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn handles to rotate stars, conquer the mini-game, and discover hidden hearts, on a slow voyage across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts are cleverly tucked away among the background art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1785943263\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1785943263 width=1560 height=1184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪐Hop between planets at your own pace, and in your way!✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is full of clever gimmicks, including a slot machine, musical instruments, a mini-game, and even levers that can rotate entire planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the right puzzles to board rockets and travel to the next planet. 🚀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the vast universe will expand in open-world fashion. There are no time limits, leaving you free to explore new worlds and hunt for hearts at your own laidback pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop back and forth between adorable, off-kilter planets as you solve the riddles of the stars, uncovering all there is to be found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/bbe8b5c8ce89f074a09c3ce5802bdd74.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨Hand-drawn art🖊</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intricate universe of Heartreasure was lovingly illustrated using ballpoint pen. Find hidden hearts to trigger adorable animations and reveal cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎶A heartwarming soundtrack🎹</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1785943263\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1785943263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.poster.avif?t=1785943263\" width=840 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.webm?t=1785943263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.mp4?t=1785943263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪐Manipulate puzzles and uncover hidden hearts!✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interactive picture book style puzzles and mechanisms while hunting for hidden hearts across a ballpoint pen illustrated universe, in this sandbox object hunting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn handles to rotate stars, conquer the mini-game, and discover hidden hearts, on a slow voyage across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts are cleverly tucked away among the background art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1785943263\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1785943263 width=1560 height=1184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪐Hop between planets at your own pace, and in your way!✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is full of clever gimmicks, including a slot machine, musical instruments, a mini-game, and even levers that can rotate entire planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the right puzzles to board rockets and travel to the next planet. 🚀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the vast universe will expand in open-world fashion. There are no time limits, leaving you free to explore new worlds and hunt for hearts at your own laidback pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop back and forth between adorable, off-kilter planets as you solve the riddles of the stars, uncovering all there is to be found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/bbe8b5c8ce89f074a09c3ce5802bdd74.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨Hand-drawn art🖊</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intricate universe of Heartreasure was lovingly illustrated using ballpoint pen. Find hidden hearts to trigger adorable animations and reveal cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎶A heartwarming soundtrack🎹</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1785943263\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1785943263\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1785943263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>",
